Brand grid and layout rules
title end

paragraph start
Use one grid for all formats, with the title area, the subject area and the caption area kept in the same relative places. Each platform covers parts of the frame with its own buttons and text.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Measure the safe area per platform on the platform pages and record it here once. Keep logos, captions and key overlays inside the shared safe area.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
format, shape, title area, subject area, caption area, safe margin
code end

